The deployed-site sections of the console README. `crates/docs/src/console.rs` substitutes
these bytes into `crates/docs/assets/console/README.md` when it emits that document into the
assembled console tree, so the header rides in this sidecar rather than inline: the bytes are
concatenated into a document that already carries one.

The file lives OUTSIDE `assets/console/` on purpose. That directory is the published npm
package's root, and this content documents the service worker, the PWA shell and the measured
byte table of the deployed tree — files the package does not ship.
